[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-mcgill-university-entrance-bursary-2026-canada-exploring-opportunities-282":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},282,"mcgill-university-entrance-bursary-2026-canada-exploring-opportunities-282","Mcgill University Entrance Bursary 2026 Canada: Exploring Opportunities","\u003Cp>International students who are willing to study in Canadian universities are hereby invited to apply for the McGill University Entrance Bursary 2025 in Canada.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The goal of the program is to make the University more accessible to those who face financial challenges by supplementing other funding resources such as government aid, Indigenous Band Support Funding, part-time work, parental support, and other sources of funding.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>McGill University Entrance Bursary Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: McGill University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarship\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-canada\u002F\">Study-In-Canada\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Canada\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: June 30, 202\u003C\u002Fstrong>6\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>McGill University Entrance Bursary Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The McGill University Entrance Bursary Program offers \u003Cstrong>entrance bursaries\u003C\u002Fstrong> to students from low to modest-income families who demonstrate financial need. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>McGill University is committed to supporting the academic pursuits of qualified undergraduate students who require financial assistance.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The goal of the program is to make the University more accessible to those who face financial challenges by supplementing other funding resources such as government aid, Indigenous Band Support Funding, part-time work, parental support, and other sources of funding.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>McGill University Entrance Bursary Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The Entrance Bursary program will provide financial aid for future undergraduates.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>McGill University Entrance Bursary Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the McGill University Entrance Bursary, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Enroll in a full-time degree program at the University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Demonstrate financial need, including the intention to apply for government student aid and\u002For Indigenous Band Support Funding \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for McGill University Entrance Bursary\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the McGill University Entrance Bursary, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the details of the program on this webpage\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Click on the button below to visit the program’s website.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply for an undergraduate degree at McGill University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Upon notification of acceptance to the University (either by formal letter or via the Admissions Status page on Minerva), the application becomes available on \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fhorizon.mcgill.ca\u002Fpban1\u002Ftwbkwbis.P_WWWLogin\">Minerva\u003C\u002Fa>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>There are two steps to complete:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>1. In Minerva:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Select the Financial Aid\u002FAwards tab &gt; Financial Aid Menu &gt; Apply for a McGill Entrance Bursary &gt; Apply to Entrance Bursary Program &gt; Complete then submit your application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>2. Submit a \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcssprofile.collegeboard.org\u002F\">CSS Financial Aid Profile\u003C\u002Fa> if you are a:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Canadian (citizen or permanent resident) students living outside of Canada\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>U.S. students\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>International (non-US) students\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.mcgill.ca\u002Fstudentaid\u002Fscholarships-aid\u002Ffuture-undergrads\u002Fneed?utm_source=ScholarsWorld\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.mcgill.ca\u002Fstudentaid\u002Fscholarships-aid\u002Ffuture-undergrads\u002Fneed?utm_source=ScholarsWorld\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-06-08 11:22:57",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmcgill-university-entrance-bursary-2026-canada-exploring-opportunities\u002F6a26980103cf34.00970583_scr